{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53175","headline":"扣舷歌 二 · 黄子野","name":"扣舷歌 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几日江头醉不醒，满天风雪卧沧溟。\n定知酒伴无寻处，门外松涛坐独听。\n（《坚瓠壬集》卷一引明徐𤊹《榕阴新检》\n以上二诗承张靖龙同志录示。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄子野","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}